       "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/loose.dtd\">\n<html><body><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#F40009;\"><u>Colorado Investment Property Search<br>\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://idx-acnt-ihouseprd.b-cdn.net/AR1140900/file_man%7BC%7D%7BC%7D%7BC%7D%7BC%7D%7BC%7D%7BC%7D%7BC%7D%7BC%7D%7BC%7D<!--cke_bookmark_90S-->%7BC%7D%7BC%7D%7BC%7D%7BC%7D%7BC%7D%7BC%7D%7BC%7D%7BC%7D%7BC%7D<!--cke_bookmark_90E-->ager/Featured%20Communities/Featured-Community-213445882.jpg?width=600&amp;height=398&amp;aspect_ratio=600%3A398\" style=\"height: 398px; width: 600px;\" srcset=\"https://idx-acnt-ihouseprd.b-cdn.net/AR1140900/file_man{C}{C}{C}{C}{C}{C}{C}{C}{C}<!--cke_bookmark_90S-->{C}{C}{C}{C}{C}{C}{C}{C}{C}<!--cke_bookmark_90E-->ager/Featured%20Communities/Featured-Community-213445882.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=796&amp;aspect_ratio=600%3A398 2x\"></u></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Finding opportunity to create cashflow for&nbsp;Investors is one of the most rewarding aspects of being a Realtor.&nbsp;&nbsp;Once Christine became a Realtor, she was able to help others create wealth.&nbsp;She has developed a data-driven process when searching for the perfect investment property for each of her Clients.<br>\r\n\t\t\t<br>\r\n\t\t\tChristine invested in Real Estate&nbsp;many years before becoming a&nbsp;Realtor.&nbsp; She brings&nbsp;experience in single family rental property, multiplex, condos, Lease with Option to Buy,&nbsp;Fix and Flips, Short Term Rentals, including Airbnb, pre-foreclosures, foreclosures and Creative Financing.</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">Christine actively searches for property with cashflow potential. When she finds one, she:&nbsp;</h3>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<ol>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Presents the information to her Northern Colorado Investor Network at biweekly meetings.</span></li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Sends an Investor Alert email to all subscribed members.</span></li>\r\n\t\t\t</ol>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<hr>\r\n\t\t\t<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">Get&nbsp;notified when excellent investment opportunity is found:</h3>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table></body></html>\n"
